I'm a developer living in Australia. Lately my free time is spent
exploring the [Zig](https://ziglang.org) programming language and
development of [Scripturial](https://scripturial.com/) in Godot and
[Lexica](https://github.com/loftafi/lexica) in SDL3.

This site is a simple [log](/log) of things I am currently learning and/or
wanting to refer back to later.



